The build used by [[gw:Assassin|Assassins]] in the form of [[gw:Anton|Anton]] or [[gw:Nika|Nika]] in [[gw:Costume Brawl|Costume Brawl]].

==Skills and Attributes==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=assassin/any dag=12 cri=11 sha=9][Aura of Displacement][Golden Phoenix Strike][Horns of the Ox][Falling Lotus Strike][Twisting Fangs][Shadow Refuge][Dash][Signet of Malice][/build]
</pvxbig>

== Equipment ==
* [[gw:Bronze Daggers|Bronze Daggers]]
** Piercing Dmg: 7-17 (Requires 12 Dagger Mastery) 
** Damage +15% (while Health is above 50%) 
** Damage +20% 

== Usage ==
* Shadow Step with [[gw:Aura of Displacement|Aura of Displacement]].
* [[gw:Golden Phoenix Strike|Golden Phoenix Strike]] → [[gw:Horns of the Ox|Horns of the Ox]] → [[gw:Falling Lotus Strike|Falling Lotus Strike]] → [[gw:Twisting Fangs|Twisting Fangs]]
* Use [[gw:Dash|Dash]] to keep up with kiting foes or to move between shrines. 
* Use [[gw:Signet of Malice|Signet of Malice]] after your chain or on foes already suffering from conditions to remove conditions.
* while [[gw:Aura of Displacement|Aura of Displacement]] is recharging, precast [[gw:Shadow Refuge|Shadow Refuge]] for [[gw:Golden Phoenix Strike|Golden Phoenix Strike]].

== Notes ==
* [[gw:Aura of Displacement|Aura of Displacement]] can be used for positioning or escaping from tight situations.

